From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rdkb-cli: add visual auto-layout and topology exports

Make the two topology toolbar placeholders functional without changing the
EasyMesh network.  Auto-layout releases the displayed nodes, runs a bounded
D3 force/collision layout, caches the result, and fits it into the viewport.
Export downloads the current topology as structured JSON or the visible
diagram as standalone SVG or PNG; raster/vector exports embed their icons so
the files remain portable.

All behavior is browser-side.  It does not submit steering, policy, channel,
or wmediumd commands.

